{"id": "s01", "text": "我没事，我挺好的。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.75, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他刚在电话里得知母亲病重，声音有点抖。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面说自己没事挺好，但刚得知母亲病重、声音发抖，实为强撑掩饰，内心痛苦无力。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s02", "text": "随便吧，我无所谓了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.15, "dominance": 0.4}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.1}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "连续三次面试失败后，她低着头，手指无意识地抠着桌角。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是淡然无所谓，但连续失败后低头抠桌角的姿态暴露了深深的挫败与无力，实为强撑的放弃。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s03", "text": "我早就习惯了，一个人也挺好。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "朋友约她聚会，她一个人在家，刚看到朋友圈别人热闹的合照。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面说习惯独处、一个人也好，显得平静接受；但看到朋友圈热闹合照后独自在家，实为逞强掩饰孤独失落，内心被动低落。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s04", "text": "真的，你不用担心我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他失眠两周了，黑眼圈明显，说话时眼睛一直看着地面。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是安慰对方、显得自己能撑住，但失眠两周、黑眼圈、低头说话暴露了疲惫无力，真实情绪是低落且逞强。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s05", "text": "我不需要别人可怜我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.75}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "被裁员后，他在老同学聚会上被问起近况，语气突然硬起来。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是拒绝怜悯、维护自尊的强硬宣言，但被裁员后当众被问近况，语气突然硬起来暴露的是被戳痛后的防御与逞强，内心其实脆弱不安。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s06", "text": "行，都是我的错，行了吧。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "和伴侣吵架，她其实很委屈，最后甩下这句话，声音在抖。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是认错让步，实为反讽赌气，声音发抖暴露委屈与无力，与表面的服软掌控相矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s07", "text": "我很快乐啊，你看我像不快乐吗。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.8, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.85, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她的笑容很用力，眼眶却红了，语速越来越快。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面宣称快乐并反问，但用力笑容、泛红眼眶和加快语速暴露强撑的悲伤与失控。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s08", "text": "没事，小伤而已。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他摔了一跤，膝盖在流血，却硬撑着说没事。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面上轻描淡写表示没事，但膝盖流血硬撑，真实情绪是疼痛与勉强，嘴上逞强与内心相反。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s09", "text": "我不累，真的不累。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.1, "dominance": 0.15}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她已经连续加班三周，说话都提不起力气，声音越来越轻。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是逞强说没事，但声音越来越轻、提不起力气，真实是极度疲惫无力，与字面明显矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s10", "text": "挺好的，一切都挺好的。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他刚搬去陌生城市，房子空荡荡的，这句话说得很轻。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面说一切都好，但语气轻、空荡房间和陌生城市的背景透露出孤独与无力，是逞强掩饰。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s11", "text": "你看我像有事的样子吗？", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她躲在厕所哭完出来，脸上还挂着没擦干的泪痕，却笑着反问。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是轻松自信的反问，但刚哭完、泪痕未干，强撑笑容掩饰脆弱，真实情绪是悲伤无力。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s12", "text": "我一个人能行。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.3}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他刚动完手术，家人要留下来照顾，他挥手赶人，声音发虚。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是自信逞强，但术后声音发虚、挥手赶人，实为虚弱又不愿拖累家人的勉强。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s13", "text": "哦，那可真是太好了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.12, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.3}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "升职名单里没有他，他扯了扯嘴角，语气平平。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是祝贺好消息，但升职落空后扯嘴角、语气平平，实为冷淡反讽与失落。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s14", "text": "谢谢你的关心，我感动得不得了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.6}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她面无表情地回了这句，转身就走。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是感激感动，但面无表情转身就走说明是冷淡反讽，真实情绪负面且疏离。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s15", "text": "今天真是完美的一天。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.95, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他丢了钱包，淋了一身雨，回家摔上门才说这句。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是极度正面的赞美，但丢钱包、淋雨、摔门的语境表明这是反讽，真实情绪是烦躁、沮丧且无力。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s16", "text": "我这辈子都不可能原谅他。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.8}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.03, "arousal": 0.85, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "说起当年抛下他们的父亲，她声音发颤，攥紧了拳头。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词字面是决绝的恨意与掌控姿态，但声音发颤、攥拳透露出压抑的伤痛与无力，情绪方向一致，只是支配感弱于字面。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s17", "text": "为什么偏偏是我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.25}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.08, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.15}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她坐在医院走廊，手里的化验单被攥成一团。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是质问命运的不公，带着委屈与无力；结合攥皱化验单的医院场景，真实情绪是更深的绝望与失控感，与字面一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s18", "text": "我好像撑不下去了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.08, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.1}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.15, "dominance": 0.05}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "深夜，她声音很轻，像是用尽了所有力气。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面直接表达绝望无力，声音轻得像用尽力气，真实情绪同样低落疲惫，二者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s19", "text": "没人真的在乎我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.1}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.03, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.05}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "生日那天没人记得，她躲在被子里，声音闷闷的。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "闷在被子里低声自语，字面与真实情绪一致，都是低落、无力、被忽视的悲伤。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s20", "text": "我想他了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.2}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.15}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "整理旧物翻到父亲的照片，她鼻子一酸。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面直白表达思念，语气低沉带鼻酸，真实情绪是悲伤与无力，二者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s21", "text": "我好害怕。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.15}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.1}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他声音很小，像是怕被别人听到。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词直白表达恐惧，声音很小、怕被听到，真实情绪同样是压抑的害怕，字面与真实一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s22", "text": "你根本不懂我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.7, "dominance": 0.55}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.85, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "和妈妈又吵起来，她吼出这句，眼眶发红。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是控诉与指责，语气强硬；但眼眶发红、争吵中吼出，真实是委屈无力、情绪激动，支配感低。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s23", "text": "闭嘴，别说了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.85, "dominance": 0.8}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.9, "dominance": 0.55}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "对方一针见血戳中他的痛处，他突然提高音量。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是强势命令，但被戳痛处后提高音量，实为防御性失控，支配感虚高而内里被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s24", "text": "我受够了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.8, "dominance": 0.65}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他把手机砸在桌上，深吸一口气。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "砸手机、深吸气配合“受够了”是真实爆发的愤怒与决绝，字面与真实情绪一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s25", "text": "你能不能放过我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.35}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.9, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "连续被追问，她崩溃地喊出来。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是请求放过，带负面与一定激动；结合崩溃喊出的语境，真实情绪是极度痛苦、被逼到极限的无力与激动，与字面方向一致只是强度更高。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s26", "text": "我该怎么办。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.15}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.1}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她被突如其来的变故打懵，声音里全是茫然。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是求助的疑问，声音茫然无措，真实情绪同样是无助与低掌控，两者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s27", "text": "明天会更好吗。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.4}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他望着窗外，像是在问自己。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是带着希望的疑问，但望着窗外像问自己，透出迷茫与无力，真实情绪偏消极被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s28", "text": "我睡不着。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.3}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "凌晨三点，她发来这条消息。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "凌晨三点直白陈述失眠，字面与真实情绪一致，都偏负面、低唤起、被动无力。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s29", "text": "今天天气真好。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "周末清晨，她伸了个懒腰。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "周末清晨伸懒腰后感叹天气好，字面与真实情绪一致，都是轻松愉悦。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s30", "text": "我做到了！", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.95, "arousal": 0.9, "dominance": 0.85}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.95, "arousal": 0.9, "dominance": 0.85}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她兴奋地挥舞着录取通知书。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是成功宣告，配合挥舞录取通知书的兴奋动作，真实情绪同样高涨且自信，表里一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s31", "text": "谢谢你们。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.55}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.9, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.5}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "手术很成功，他握紧医生的手。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "手术成功后的真诚感激，握紧医生的手显示情绪激动，字面与真实情绪一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s32", "text": "这顿饭真好吃。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.5, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.9, "arousal": 0.65, "dominance": 0.65}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "和朋友聚餐，她笑得眯起眼睛。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是真诚夸赞，配合眯眼笑的表情，真实情绪同样愉悦且更放松，二者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s33", "text": "我终于想通了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.8, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.75}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他长舒一口气，眉头舒展开来。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "长舒一口气、眉头舒展，语气释然放松，字面与真实情绪一致，都是想通后的轻松与掌控感。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s34", "text": "还好，不算太糟。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.4}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "项目出了点岔子，他耸耸肩，还能笑得出来。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面说“还好”显得轻松，但项目出岔子还耸肩强笑，实为掩饰焦虑、故作镇定，真实情绪偏负面且被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s35", "text": "就那样吧。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.45, "arousal": 0.15, "dominance": 0.4}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.12, "dominance": 0.3}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "被问起最近怎么样，他淡淡地回了一句。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是平淡敷衍的中性回应，语气淡淡透出疲惫与无奈，情绪略偏负面但未到明显反讽，故不算矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s36", "text": "我先挂了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.4, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.7}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她声音突然冷下来，不想再聊。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是平静的结束通话，但声音突然冷下来，真实情绪偏负面且主动切断对话，两者不矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s37", "text": "你走吧。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.15}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她背对着他，声音很轻，肩膀却在抖。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是平静放手的命令，但背对、声音轻、肩膀发抖暴露她在强忍哭泣、内心痛苦且无力挽留。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s38", "text": "别管我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他把自己锁在房间，声音从门后传来，闷闷的。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是强硬拒绝、要求别管，显得有掌控；但门后闷闷的声音透出低落无力，实为逞强掩饰脆弱。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s39", "text": "我还好。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "接到关心的电话，她顿了顿，声音有点哑。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面说“还好”显得平静正面，但接电话时顿了顿、声音发哑，透露出压抑的难过与无力，真实情绪偏负面且被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s40", "text": "都过去了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.15, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "聊起那段最难的日子，她眼神飘向远处，声音很轻。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是释然放下，但眼神飘远、声音很轻，透出无力与未愈的伤感，是逞强式的轻描淡写。", "human_gold": false}
